    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steal It</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal It is an online multiplayer game \ud83c\udfae where it depends on who has the most coins \ud83e\ude99 at the end of a round. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins can either be obtained as rewards by completing tasks \u2705 or by stealing them from other players \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has two game modes: a team mode \ud83e\udd1d and a free-for-all mode \ud83d\udca5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In team mode, there are two teams. One team tries to get coins by completing tasks \ud83e\udde9 while the other tries to steal them undetected \ud83d\ude08. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The players have the opportunity to track down thieves \ud83e\uddd0 and lock them up in prison \ud83d\ude94.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the free-for-all mode, everyone is on their own \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f. At certain time intervals \u23f3, the abilities you can use will change \ud83d\udd04. You can either steal \ud83d\udd76\ufe0f or perform tasks \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shadow-Heist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadow-Heist</strong> is a team-based mode where two sides face off\u2014<strong>Owners</strong> and <strong>Thieves</strong>.Owners must complete tasks around the map to collect coins \ud83d\udcb0, while the Thieves blend in with the crowd, trying to steal without getting caught. \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udd13</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each team has 3 unique abilities to give them an edge. Owners can use abilities to move faster or place decoy bodies, while Thieves have tools to remain undetected, like a signal jammer or an ability to temporarily disable another player. \ud83c\udfaf\ud83d\udd27</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Owners suspect someone is a Thief, they can call for a vote to send players to jail. \ud83d\udea8 But they need to be careful\u2014they only have a limited number of votes! Shadow-Heist is a thrilling mix of strategy, deception, and deduction, where every decision counts. \ud83e\udde0\ud83c\udfad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All-Steal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All Steal is a chaotic and fast-paced mode where it\u2019s every player for themselves! \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udca8 In this free-for-all mode, your goal is to collect as many coins as possible while outsmarting your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The twist? Players must complete tasks scattered around the map to earn coins, but they can also steal from others \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83d\udd13. Timing is everything\u2014knowing when to complete objectives and when to strike is key to dominating the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the match progresses, the action ramps up, and the stakes get higher. Whether you\u2019re sneaking around or pulling off risky heists, All Steal keeps you on your toes with unpredictable and dynamic gameplay! \ud83d\udca5</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steal It</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal It is an online multiplayer game \ud83c\udfae where it depends on who has the most coins \ud83e\ude99 at the end of a round. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins can either be obtained as rewards by completing tasks \u2705 or by stealing them from other players \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has two game modes: a team mode \ud83e\udd1d and a free-for-all mode \ud83d\udca5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In team mode, there are two teams. One team tries to get coins by completing tasks \ud83e\udde9 while the other tries to steal them undetected \ud83d\ude08. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The players have the opportunity to track down thieves \ud83e\uddd0 and lock them up in prison \ud83d\ude94.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the free-for-all mode, everyone is on their own \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f. At certain time intervals \u23f3, the abilities you can use will change \ud83d\udd04. You can either steal \ud83d\udd76\ufe0f or perform tasks \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shadow-Heist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadow-Heist</strong> is a team-based mode where two sides face off\u2014<strong>Owners</strong> and <strong>Thieves</strong>.Owners must complete tasks around the map to collect coins \ud83d\udcb0, while the Thieves blend in with the crowd, trying to steal without getting caught. \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udd13</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each team has 3 unique abilities to give them an edge. Owners can use abilities to move faster or place decoy bodies, while Thieves have tools to remain undetected, like a signal jammer or an ability to temporarily disable another player. \ud83c\udfaf\ud83d\udd27</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Owners suspect someone is a Thief, they can call for a vote to send players to jail. \ud83d\udea8 But they need to be careful\u2014they only have a limited number of votes! Shadow-Heist is a thrilling mix of strategy, deception, and deduction, where every decision counts. \ud83e\udde0\ud83c\udfad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All-Steal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All Steal is a chaotic and fast-paced mode where it\u2019s every player for themselves! \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udca8 In this free-for-all mode, your goal is to collect as many coins as possible while outsmarting your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The twist? Players must complete tasks scattered around the map to earn coins, but they can also steal from others \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83d\udd13. Timing is everything\u2014knowing when to complete objectives and when to strike is key to dominating the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the match progresses, the action ramps up, and the stakes get higher. Whether you\u2019re sneaking around or pulling off risky heists, All Steal keeps you on your toes with unpredictable and dynamic gameplay! \ud83d\udca5</p>",
